            %p
              of the internal hom which is maximal subject to the property that the composition of prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CompositionOfInternalFunctionsInSheafTopos"}
              becomes invertible.
            %p
              The (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"}> homotopy
              \-)
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+theory"} type theory
